<title>CANADA: Int'l Verifact buys 85 pct of National Transaction Network Inc.</title>
<headline>Int'l Verifact buys 85 pct of National Transaction Network Inc.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Verifact Inc said on Tuesday it acquired an 85 percent stake in National Transaction Network Inc.</p>
<p>BCE Investments Canada Inc and shareholder Nelson Doubleday sold their National Transaction Network holdings to International Verifact for about 231,000 International Verifact common shares, it said.</p>
<p>National Transaction, based in Hudson, Massachusetts, designs electronic payment systems for stores. Toronto-based International Verifact also makes payment systems for retailers, banks and governments.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
